comments[15]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-12T19:21:47.566Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: fresh opt-in tracing search, open/in_progress inventories and complete all-status corpus review found the completed sampling-knob and lazy-startup owners but no exact active implementation owner. Their full live metadata was read. This enhancement remains open and unclaimed; the four connected implementation owners remain the only active items."
  "2026-10-12T21:58:24.817Z","harness:codex","Fresh explicit unbrained/pm-cli Sentry queries during this delivery again return0 unresolved issues and0 recent trace rows. The14-day authenticated Sentry/telemetry gate passes with0 critical/high issues,3.01% finish error rate and0 failures without error codes. Successful-command tracing remains unproven and is retained here open/unclaimed; metrics-service recovery in pm-m1tfmp is independent from Sentry trace instrumentation."
  "2026-10-13T04:40:54.426Z","harness:codex","Delivery intake: complete strict all-status read of 2949 items with zero omissions and zero unreadable files; closed lineage and current GitHub reports inspected. Fresh authenticated Sentry query returns zero 24h traces and zero unresolved issues. Implement explicit successful-command opt-in without default SDK loading and preserve consent/test isolation. Bundle with canonical eligible Sentry11 migration and privacy hardening in one reviewed PR."
  "2026-10-13T04:50:31.051Z","harness:codex","Sentry11 migration was correctly refused by portable native runtime staging and paused on pm-t3jxjj. Current10.76.0 already provides typed dataCollection and streamed-span wrappers: successful tracing and privacy implementation use those supported primitives without raising artifact budgets. All argument slots are redacted, even text resembling flags; option keys retain structural diagnostics."
  "2026-10-13T05:01:44.198Z","harness:codex","Verified71 focused tests through the real CLI and disposable loopback Sentry collector. Streamed envelopes retain pm.command_root and command_ok; default zero-rate consent-opt-out and Vitest cases export nothing. Isolated source mutant restoring no successful initialization fails the independent assertion with exit1 while original passes0. Authenticated fresh Sentry span query now shows one actual pm context span at04:54:27UTC from explicit sampling; legacy transaction-only trace-list remains empty. Required14-day Sentry gate has0 critical/high issues;7-day telemetry error rate3.00 percent with0 missing codes. Moved integration test into the telemetry domain directory to preserve the existing folder-density cap; command identities are immutable so replacement uses audited remove/add."
  "2026-10-13T06:05:28.578Z","harness:codex","Final independent tracing control uses the current consent-aware signature: isolated checkout baseline exits0 and removing opt-in initialization makes the same assertion fail with exit1. Focused verification is100 passing tests, including real loopback Sentry export and packed SDK Node/Bun continuation. Latest pm-changelog2026.10.12 is installed and activated through pm package install; full configured generation remains part of reviewed closeout."
  "2026-10-13T08:36:53.517Z","harness:codex","Candidate validation: explicit successful-command tracing has real loopback export and independent initialization-refusal controls, remains lazy by default, and respects configured consent, process opt-outs, zero sampling and Vitest isolation. Current linked80 Sentry tests and typecheck pass; final packed npm/Bun/npx/bunx smoke passes9 package workflows under unchanged artifact budgets. Authenticated span discovery for the compiled delivery shows actual pm context span bfd10b169aabf415 at2026-10-13T07:42:47UTC, separate from the prior legacy transaction-only query. Full coverage before the final strict-consent comparison passes10362 tests at exact100/100/100/100; hosted final coverage includes five extra JS boundary cases."
  "2026-10-13T08:49:51.375Z","harness:codex","Reviewed-closeout preparation: post-closure defect-evidence gate passes. Latest pm-changelog2026.10.12 generated the canonical all-release-tag/status/exclusion projection and its configured check reports unchanged with2636 included items. Unreleased contains exactly the three implementation owners in Added/Changed/Fixed; the32 historical scanner reconciliations are excluded. No manual changelog editing or package-owned workaround was needed."
  "2026-10-13T09:51:03.273Z","harness:codex","Review evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1455#discussion_r4257006476. Exact be4553aec head has37 successful checks plus neutral/skipped provider results; merge is blocked by two unresolved actionable CodeRabbit threads. Reuse this owner for explicit tracing permission even with an existing client. Sourcery reports a temporary free quota limit, Cubic a monthly free limit and Greptile an expired trial; none is treated as approval."
  "2026-10-13T10:21:51.575Z","harness:codex","PR1455 remediation verified: the SDK initializer now returns explicit boolean tracing permission and both CLI lifecycle branches guard context/span creation with it. Existing clients require current opt-in, nonzero sampling, hard process policy and effective consent. The independent preinitialized-default collector assertion fails before correction and passes afterward. Snapshot signature acknowledgment applies only to this PR-new, unpublished API: released2026.10.13 contains no ensureSentryCommandTracing export. Current90 linked Sentry tests, typecheck, ESLint, final packed9-package npm/Bun/npx/bunx acceptance and full10377-test exact100/100/100/100 coverage pass. Initial PRhead be4553aec has37 successful checks; renewed exact-head checks/review remain required."
  "2026-10-13T11:04:54.036Z","harness:codex","PR1455 revised review https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1455#discussion_r4257567292 exposed consent revocation during the command action. Real bin collector control observes a forbidden exported span on b80427b5d and zero command spans after re-reading consent and installation identity before completion. Added public sentryDiscardCommandSpan plus command-owned completion on success/error paths; extracted shared lifecycle helpers to restore the unchanged CodeFactor complexity ceiling. Current121 focused tests and typecheck pass; full final coverage and hosted checks remain pending."
  "2026-10-13T12:19:46.550Z","harness:codex","PR1455 review https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1455#discussion_r4258301245: the independent supported-CLI control rejects the external completion settings read after span start. Before correction the successful contracts action prints its result but receives an unhandled-error diagnostic and skips span discard. Default completion consent to false and catch only this optional read failure; retain normal after-command telemetry and bounded flush. No production test seam is added."
  "2026-10-13T12:34:03.494Z","harness:codex","Final review control passes after correction: optional completion settings rejection now discards the span, verifies false SDK permission, preserves successful telemetry completion and performs the bounded flush. The identical public-CLI assertion failed before the fix with an unhandled-error diagnostic after successful output. All125 focused checks and97 linked Sentry checks pass. Direct ESLint on changed files with an empty suppression file, typecheck, SDK surface and final9-package packed npm/Bun/npx/bunx gates pass. Prior exact86c155c42 hosted coverage is100/100/100/100; the new head must repeat hosted checks and review."
  "2026-10-13T13:26:44.508Z","harness:codex","PR1455 final initialization review https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1455#discussion_r4258991731: both loader and initializer controls reject before correction. The SDK tracing boundary now clears its partial client and returns false while retaining the completed initialization attempt, so subsequent calls do not retry. Unchanged controls pass after correction;127 focused checks and99 linked Sentry checks, direct empty-baseline lint, typecheck, unchanged SDK surface and9 packed npm/Bun/npx/bunx workflows pass. Prior8cb1a2ea3 has all required checks green; revised exact-head coverage and review remain mandatory."
  "2026-10-13T13:35:10.714Z","harness:codex","SDK publication review found an adjacent concurrent-call escape: after an initializer rejection, one caller returned false but a second caller received the cached partial module and returned true. The identical Promise.all control fails before correction with[false,true] and passes after with[false,false]. Publish the module only after init succeeds, retain the completed attempt and clear failed tracing state. All128 focused checks and100 linked Sentry checks, direct empty-baseline ESLint, typecheck and final9-package packed Node/Bun/npx/bunx workflows pass; no SDK signature or dependency changes."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-13T05:01:45.527Z","harness:codex",Use Sentry span discovery to verify streamed-span ingestion; a legacy transaction-only trace listing can be empty even when recent spans exist. Real loopback envelopes prove initialization flush and serialization separately from SaaS ingestion.
